From: Automation Platform controller <controller@pipefail.dev>
Subject: [PATCH 0002] session leases: an expired organization deletes itself

Implements: ADR-0001 increment 2 (CTL-040; retires the external sweeper class)
Tested by:  unit (lease GC state coverage) + live lease-expiry proof on prod1.

Organizations gain a nullable, indexed `expires_at` (settable through the
API). The deletion pump feeds any organization past its lease into the same
observable deletion state machine as an explicit DELETE — jobs preserved,
children reaped in order, zero strands. Ephemeral session orgs clean
themselves up without cron sweepers; an org already being deleted is never
double-scheduled (the exclusion covers exactly the non-terminal states,
asserted by unit test).

